<title>USA: Warner to run Time Warner, Turner libraries.</title>
<headline>Warner to run Time Warner, Turner libraries.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Warner Inc and Turner Broadcasting Systems Inc said on Thursday that responsibility for the companies' libraries, animation and syndication divisions would be consolidated at Warner Brothers.</p>
<p>The companies also said in a statement that responsibility for consumer products, home video and technical support would be consolidated under Warner Brothers, but declined to comment on any potential cost savings.</p>
</text>
